WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:05.978
AI Study Helper

00:00:06.028 --> 00:00:12.402
Click AI Study Helper in the sidebar. It is a tutor that knows your class and subjects.

00:00:15.354 --> 00:00:18.753
Click one of the suggestions to ask it right away.

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:29.372
Or type your own question in the box and press Enter. Shift and Enter start a new line.

00:00:33.706 --> 00:00:40.614
You can send up to 30 messages a day. Your chat is saved, so you can come back to it later.

00:00:41.533 --> 00:00:45.582
Click Clear Chat to delete the conversation and start again.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:53.143
Learn with help
